{{also|Save|savé|savè|savê|šave|'save}}
==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*solh₂-}}
{{etymon|en|id=to keep safe|inh|enm>saven>to keep safe|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|saven}}, {{m|enm|sauven}}, a borrowing from {{der|en|fro|sauver}}, from {{der|en|LL.|salvo|salvāre|t=to save}}.

